            "title": "Trump prepared to hit China with $60 billion in annual tariffs ...",
            "snippets": [
              "# Trump prepared to hit China with $60 billion in annual tariffs\nPresident Trump is preparing to impose a package of $60 billion in annual tariffs against Chinese products, following through on a longtime threat that he says will punish China for intellectual property theft and create more U.S. jobs.\n\nThe tariff package, which Trump plans to unveil by Friday, was confirmed by four senior administration officials.",
